224 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (The AI-assisted workflow is designed to support, not replace, user judgement. A user submits suspicious text or supported content to the scam checker. The system analyses indicators such as urgency, requests for confidential information, suspicious payment instructions or unusual links, then explains possible warning signs and recommends cautious next steps. The Gemini chatbot answers general cybersecurity questions. If a user has experienced an incident, they can enter relevant details and manually choose to generate a structured complaint draft. The user must review the draft and submit it through the appropriate official channel.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
225 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (The proposed solution combines an AI-assisted scam checker, a Gemini-powered cybersecurity chatbot, multilingual cyber-safety information, an awareness center, emergency support links and an optional complaint-file generator. It is designed around clarity, accessibility and user control.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
